{"page":379,"verses":[{"verse_key":"27:23","surah":27,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"إِنِّى وَجَدتُّ ٱمْرَأَةً تَمْلِكُهُمْ وَأُوتِيَتْ مِن كُلِّ شَىْءٍ وَلَهَا عَرْشٌ عَظِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"I found a woman ruling over the people, who has been given a share of everything- she has a magnificent throne-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنِّى","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"27:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَجَدتُّ","en_gloss":"found","transliteration":"wajadttu","verse_key":"27:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱمْرَأَةًۭ","en_gloss":"a woman","transliteration":"im'ra-atan","verse_key":"27:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَمْلِكُهُمْ","en_gloss":"ruling them","transliteration":"tamlikuhum","verse_key":"27:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأُوتِيَتْ","en_gloss":"and she has been given","transliteration":"waūtiyat","verse_key":"27:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"27:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"27:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"27:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَهَا","en_gloss":"and for her","transliteration":"walahā","verse_key":"27:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَرْشٌ","en_gloss":"(is) a throne","transliteration":"ʿarshun","verse_key":"27:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَظِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","verse_key":"27:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٢٣","en_gloss":"(23)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:23"}]},{"verse_key":"27:24","surah":27,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"وَجَدتُّهَا وَقَوْمَهَا يَسْجُدُونَ لِلشَّمْسِ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ وَزَيَّنَ لَهُمُ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ فَصَدَّهُمْ عَنِ ٱلسَّبِيلِ فَهُمْ لَا يَهْتَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[but] I found that she and her people worshipped the sun instead of God. Satan has made their deeds seem alluring to them, and diverted them from the right path: they cannot find the right path.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَجَدتُّهَا","en_gloss":"And I found her","transliteration":"wajadttuhā","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَقَوْمَهَا","en_gloss":"and her people","transliteration":"waqawmahā","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَسْجُدُونَ","en_gloss":"prostrating","transliteration":"yasjudūna","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِلشَّمْسِ","en_gloss":"to the sun","transliteration":"lilshamsi","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"instead of Allah","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"دُونِ","en_gloss":"instead of Allah","transliteration":"dūni","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"instead of Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَزَيَّنَ","en_gloss":"and has made fair-seeming","transliteration":"wazayyana","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَهُمُ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahumu","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their deeds","transliteration":"aʿmālahum","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَصَدَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"and averted them","transliteration":"faṣaddahum","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلسَّبِيلِ","en_gloss":"the Way","transliteration":"l-sabīli","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَهُمْ","en_gloss":"so they","transliteration":"fahum","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(are) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يَهْتَدُونَ","en_gloss":"guided","transliteration":"yahtadūna","verse_key":"27:24"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٢٤","en_gloss":"(24)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:24"}]},{"verse_key":"27:25","surah":27,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَّا يَسْجُدُوا۟ لِلَّهِ ٱلَّذِى يُخْرِجُ ٱلْخَبْءَ فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَيَعْلَمُ مَا تُخْفُونَ وَمَا تُعْلِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Should they not worship God, who brings forth what is hidden in the heavens and earth and knows both what you people conceal and what you declare?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَّا","en_gloss":"That not","transliteration":"allā","verse_key":"27:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَسْجُدُوا۟","en_gloss":"they prostrate","transliteration":"yasjudū","verse_key":"27:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"27:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"27:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُخْرِجُ","en_gloss":"brings forth","transliteration":"yukh'riju","verse_key":"27:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْخَبْءَ","en_gloss":"the hidden","transliteration":"l-khaba-a","verse_key":"27:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"27:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"27:25"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"27:25"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَيَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"and knows","transliteration":"wayaʿlamu","verse_key":"27:25"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"27:25"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تُخْفُونَ","en_gloss":"you conceal","transliteration":"tukh'fūna","verse_key":"27:25"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"27:25"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تُعْلِنُونَ","en_gloss":"you declare","transliteration":"tuʿ'linūna","verse_key":"27:25"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٢٥","en_gloss":"(25)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:25"}]},{"verse_key":"27:26","surah":27,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ رَبُّ ٱلْعَرْشِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ ۩","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He is God, there is no god but Him, the Lord of the mighty throne.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"al-lahu","verse_key":"27:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَآ","en_gloss":"(there is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"27:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَـٰهَ","en_gloss":"god","transliter