verse_key":"27:29"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٢٩","en_gloss":"(29)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:29"}]},{"verse_key":"27:30","surah":27,"ayah":30,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ مِن سُلَيْمَـٰنَ وَإِنَّهُۥ بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is from Solomon, and it says, “In the name of God, the Lord of Mercy, the Giver of Mercy,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, it","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"27:30"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(is) from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"27:30"},{"pos":3,"ar":"سُلَيْمَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"Sulaiman","transliteration":"sulaymāna","verse_key":"27:30"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَإِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"and indeed it (is)","transliteration":"wa-innahu","verse_key":"27:30"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِسْمِ","en_gloss":"In the name","transliteration":"bis'mi","verse_key":"27:30"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"27:30"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","en_gloss":"the Most Gracious","transliteration":"l-raḥmāni","verse_key":"27:30"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلرَّحِيمِ","en_gloss":"the Most Merciful","transliteration":"l-raḥīmi","verse_key":"27:30"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٣٠","en_gloss":"(30)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:30"}]},{"verse_key":"27:31","surah":27,"ayah":31,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَّا تَعْلُوا۟ عَلَىَّ وَأْتُونِى مُسْلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"do not put yourselves above me, and come to me in submission to God.”’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَّا","en_gloss":"That not","transliteration":"allā","verse_key":"27:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَعْلُوا۟","en_gloss":"exalt yourselves","transliteration":"taʿlū","verse_key":"27:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَىَّ","en_gloss":"against me","transliteration":"ʿalayya","verse_key":"27:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَأْتُونِى","en_gloss":"but come to me","transliteration":"watūnī","verse_key":"27:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مُسْلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"(in) submission","transliteration":"mus'limīna","verse_key":"27:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:31"}]},{"verse_key":"27:32","surah":27,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَتْ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلْمَلَؤُا۟ أَفْتُونِى فِىٓ أَمْرِى مَا كُنتُ قَاطِعَةً أَمْرًا حَتَّىٰ تَشْهَدُونِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"She said, ‘Counsellors, give me your counsel in the matter I now face: I only ever decide on matters in your presence.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَتْ","en_gloss":"She said","transliteration":"qālat","verse_key":"27:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"27:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْمَلَؤُا۟","en_gloss":"chiefs","transliteration":"l-mala-u","verse_key":"27:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَفْتُونِى","en_gloss":"Advise me","transliteration":"aftūnī","verse_key":"27:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"27:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَمْرِى","en_gloss":"my affair","transliteration":"amrī","verse_key":"27:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"27:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كُنتُ","en_gloss":"I would be","transliteration":"kuntu","verse_key":"27:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قَاطِعَةً","en_gloss":"the one to decide","transliteration":"qāṭiʿatan","verse_key":"27:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَمْرًا","en_gloss":"any matter","transliteration":"amran","verse_key":"27:32"},{"pos":11,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"27:32"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَشْهَدُونِ","en_gloss":"you are present with me","transliteration":"tashhadūni","verse_key":"27:32"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:32"}]},{"verse_key":"27:33","surah":27,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟ نَحْنُ أُو۟لُوا۟ قُوَّةٍ وَأُو۟لُوا۟ بَأْسٍ شَدِيدٍ وَٱلْأَمْرُ إِلَيْكِ فَٱنظُرِى مَاذَا تَأْمُرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They replied, ‘We possess great force and power in war, but you are in command, so consider what orders to give us.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū